  <item>
    <title>EP09 汽车方向盘Next Level，是真智能还是伪科技</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6670f4fcb6a841272983d510</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6670f4fcb6a841272983d510</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 02:46:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>方向盘、安全气囊、安全带作为每一辆汽车必备的零部件常常被忽略，但安全零部件恰恰是汽车产品成立的基础。如今随着电车的兴起，方向盘从造型到性能正在不断迭代，安全气囊的形态也随着真实事故场景正在不断扩充形态和配置。业内对于汽车安全这件事做了哪些创新探索呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Julia&amp; Jason 安全工程</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part One 熟悉又陌生的方向盘是怎么“养成”的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> “走遍天下都不怕”的桑塔纳方向盘是怎么诞生的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 二、三、四条幅如何抉择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">09:37</a> 二辐条方向盘迭代了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a> 原材料研发从0到1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 安全气囊演进史</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Two 智能方向盘“超有戏”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 从前车马慢，现代HOD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 驾驶辅助与自动驾驶，值得信任吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 一体式方向盘是真操控还是假智能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 方向盘危险装饰避雷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> 仪表板装饰隐患避雷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a>方向盘改装避雷</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、QQ音乐订阅“话锋一转”，全平台同步更新中~</span></p>]]></description>
