    <guid isPermaLink="false">6628cfa6200abebe6efb616b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024北京车展专业观众开放首日，有什么新车型亮相？未来的技术趋势又是怎样的？本期特别邀请上车说串台，从汽车媒体、汽车品牌以及汽车零部件3个视角出发，共同探讨由北京车展生发的对于智能座舱与技术趋势的探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>李修惠 上车说主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>杨旸 延锋创新团队</span></p><span></span><p><span>露夫子 智己设计师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part One 新车抢先看</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 史上配置最齐全的嘉宾阵容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 北京车展看点1：小米SU7</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 北京车展看点2：比亚迪秦L</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 北京车展看点3：奔驰纯电大G&amp; 宝宝巴士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">06:07</a> 北京车展看点3：智己L6智能座舱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Two 趋势敞开聊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 宝马引发的技术创新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 加配功能是否有必要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a> 实体按键VS智能表面按键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> 智能表面为代表的的“隐科技”会成为溢价的理由吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1229">20:29</a> 如何兼顾舒适性与安全性，Safe Unit给出的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 当情绪价值进入“第三空间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 汽车如何维护打工人最后的体面</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Three 当下行业议题探讨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> 智能座舱的同质化问题怎么解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 论芯片算力迭代的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a> 如何健康降本增效</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、QQ音乐订阅“话锋一转”，全平台同步更新中~</span></p>]]></description>
