  <item>
    <title>EP06 把影院全景声搬进智能座舱，汽车音响也太卷了吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f2852e696bd9a8791b6a69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f2852e696bd9a8791b6a69</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Mar 2024 05:03:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在年初的北美国际消费类电子产品展览会（CES）上，延锋CymaticX Space 声流座舱首次亮相，引发了对于未来智能座舱音响的畅想。汽车音响将如何发展，选车过程中如何选择音响配置，特邀我司音响专家一起探讨。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期嘉宾</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>卡皮&amp;巴拉 延锋Audio团队</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part One 越来越卷的车载音响，怎么选？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 声流座舱打造理念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 从消费品卷到车载音响，提升了哪些体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> 场景让音质提升成为“刚需”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 更年轻的第二起居室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> 如何打造更好的声学环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> 可用于选车的3个层级：物理层、感知层、认知层</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> 扬声器个数可以成为音响好的标准吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Two 未来音响技术如何迭代</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> SONIX声音随动技术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 体感增强体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 沉浸式音频解决方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> 全景声与环绕声如何应用于车内场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 关于新技术的量产时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a> 差异化优势在？</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、QQ音乐订阅“话锋一转”，全平台同步更新中~</span></p>]]></description>
