  <item>
    <title>EP04 马拉松热如何跟？推荐适合小白体质的跑步减肥法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ae069a16860d3ef18a03bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ae069a16860d3ef18a03bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jan 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听说在上班和上香之间，越来越多的年轻人选择上马？跑步作为一种大众爱好，因为“马拉松热”被再度翻红，有种全民开跑的趋势。小白如何无痛养成跑步习惯，如何有效提升跑步的减肥效果，这就请我司的跑步爱好者们来分享有关跑步的心得体会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>小区跑者 工程团队跑步爱好者，全马PB255</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡导 战略团队跑步爱好者，全马PB355</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part One 求证公司关于跑步减肥的“传奇故事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 开始跑步契机，2个月减重50斤！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a> 一项正反馈及时的运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> 提供另一个思考空间的运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 独自跑步VS跑团跑步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> 安利北马训练营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="539">08:59</a> 部门跑团趣事多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 好奇跑步爱好者们的朋友圈，记录还是晒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 实测：只要跑量够，胡吃海喝都不胖</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part Two 传说中的马拉松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a> 各地马拉松大盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> Tips：不建议新人0准备直接跑马拉松！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 首马313跑量分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 马拉松标准备战周期&amp;训练方法分享（专业版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> 跑步建议（入门版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a> 有效的跑步减肥逻辑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 跑步伤膝盖的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">40:11</a> 跑马的那些内心戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> 波马朝圣与东马备战</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part Three 小白如何入门跑步？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 受伤避雷帖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">47:15</a> 划重点：跑步宜配合交叉训练与力量训练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a> 0基础跑步，心态更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a> 10%原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">50:08</a> 跑步时间如何选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3228">53:48</a> 基础装备怎么选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3435">57:15</a> 安利一个宝藏体验点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3498">58:18</a> 一句话总结跑步的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在小宇宙、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、QQ音乐订阅“话锋一转”，全平台同步更新中~</span></p>]]></description>
